{"Categories":[8],"HiddenTopics":[24],"Topics":[9],"Id":61,"TextResource":{"Name":"johnny-rockets","Translations":[{"Text":"Johnny Rockets","Abbreviation":""},{"Text":"Johnny Rockets","Abbreviation":""}]},"ShapeIndexes":{"ActualShapeList":[{"FloorId":"3","Id":119}]},"Description":{"Name":"description","Translations":[{"Text":"<p>Casi 30 años de historia marcados por la excelencia y calidad en sus hamburguesas, malteadas y platos, en un local que rememora la tradición y la cultura estadounidense de los años 50. Ambiente cálido y familiar para amenizar los instantes previos a su viaje.<\/p>\n","Abbreviation":""},{"Text":"<p>Nearly 30 years of history marked by the excellence and quality of their hamburgers, milkshakes and dishes, in premises reminiscent of the American traditions and culture of the 1950's. Enliven the moments prior to your trip in a warm family type atmosphere.<\/p>\n","Abbreviation":""}]},"Created":"1488916780","Updated":"1489712604","Picture":{"Url":"http:\/\/front-airport-pudahuel.viadirect.com\/sites\/default\/files\/061_johnny-rockets.png"},"Url":{"Name":"Url","Translations":{"1":{"Text":"http:\/\/front-airport-pudahuel.viadirect.com\/en\/viadirect\/367\/node\/332","Abbreviation":""},"0":{"Text":"http:\/\/front-airport-pudahuel.viadirect.com\/es\/viadirect\/367\/node\/332","Abbreviation":""}}},"LogoMap":{"Translations":{"1":{"Url":"http:\/\/front-airport-pudahuel.viadirect.com\/sites\/default\/files\/viadirect\/logos\/map\/0\/061_johnny-rockets.png","LocalUrl":"Destinations\/61\/MapLogo_1.png"},"0":{"Url":"http:\/\/front-airport-pudahuel.viadirect.com\/sites\/default\/files\/viadirect\/logos\/map\/0\/061_johnny-rockets.png","LocalUrl":"Destinations\/61\/MapLogo_0.png"}}},"ExternalDatas":{"Data":[{"key":"field_opening_hours","label":"Opening hours","field_name":"field_restaurant_opening_hours"},{"key":"field_phone","label":"Phone","field_name":"field_restaurant_phone"},{"key":"field_website","label":"Website","field_name":"field_restaurant_website